OL,3,GNEWSACharity leader leaves #1m legacy
OL,4,Agift for county
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn organisation which provides
OL,7,Ffinancial support to charities across a
OL,8,Fcounty has received an "incredible" #1m
OL,9,Flegacy donation.
OL,11,FFounder of Carlisle Food Bank Rachael
OL,12,FRodway, who died in April 2022, left
OL,13,Fthe gift for grant-making charity
OL,14,FCumbria Community Foundation (CCF),
OL,15,Fwhich tackles issues including poverty,
OL,16,Fpoor health, inequality and climate
OL,17,Fchange.
OL,19,FThe food bank, which helps about 900
OL,20,Fpeople a month, said in July stocks
OL,21,Fwere already at the lowest level since
OL,22,Fit opened.
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,402,400,260,160,0,100
