OL,3,GNEWSACharity leader leaves #1m legacy
OL,4,Agift for county
OL,5,
OL,6,FCCF's development manager Caroline
OL,7,FAdams said the team were "stunned and
OL,8,Fdelighted" and Rodway "understood the
OL,9,FCumbrian charity sector better than
OL,10,Fanyone".
